    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      106.15,
      582.15,
      549.66,
      607.22
    ],
    "text": "(a) declare that the area of land called as \u201cGanegoda Mandalarama Purana Viharaya\u201d speci\ufb01 ed in the Schedule hereto shall be an urban development area for the purpose of the aforesaid Ordinance; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      106.15,
      624.15,
      549.67,
      649.22
    ],
    "text": "(b) direct that an outline physical plan shall be prepared for the \u201cGanegoda Mandalarama Purana Viharaya\u201d, which is declared as above to be an urban development area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
